As of this morning I have purchased my Early Bird tickets to the 2027 HomeLab Fest. I look forward to attending this event, meeting some great people, and learning more about a hobby that I have loved since the days of COVID. If you are interested in also attending, feel free to check out the event page at https://www.homelabfest.org/. This isn't sponsored, just a cool event I am looking forward too and will have more info about later!